squad.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:54 £4.5m Midfielders\n3:28 £5.0m Midfielders\n9:49 £5.5m Midfielders\n14:42 £6.0m Midfielders\n20:19 £6.5m Midfielders\n24:25 £7.0m Midfielders\n30:07 £8.0m+ Midfielders\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦   / fplmate  \n📸   / fplmate  \n🎶   / fplmate  \n🎮   / fpl_mate  \n👾   / discord  \n🏆 Join:    / @fplmate  \n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":38,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwjEoLud9quWAxUhGLMFHXBYGIVIveHY2Lm-tssLygEECGe84g==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVHBoUm1uNG05ODluU0VSZUVRNXB6bHxBR3JiS2FuQ3BoSzNsNEw5YlY4MTZhLUlybDNTZV93TTBqOTYtS0JaUHZILUp3UzRpTlgyQUtvZFMwcGFQYUNLR000YklNRlp6NzhMbXhMYXNmUVpXejNfZjRYZUR6ZFpPcHZI\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=C5bZ85sWML0","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVHBoUm1uNG05ODluU0VSZUVRNXB6bHxBR3JiS2FuQ3BoSzNsNEw5YlY4MTZhLUlybDNTZV93TTBqOTYtS0JaUHZILUp3UzRpTlgyQUtvZFMwcGFQYUNLR000YklNRlp6NzhMbXhMYXNmUVpXejNfZjRYZUR6ZFpPcHZI\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Flanding%2Ffplmate%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dyoutube%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=C5bZ85sWML0","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":79,"length":3,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CDIQ3NcEGDAiEwjEoLud9quWAxUhGLMFHXBYGIXKAQQIZ7zi","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/ad","webP